<title>USA: Williams Coal Seam Trust sets distribution.</title>
<headline>Williams Coal Seam Trust sets distribution.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Coal Seam Gas Royalty Trust says it will pay a quarterly distribution of $0.408865 per unit, as compared to $0.535875 per unit for the prior quarter.</p>
<p>The distribution will be paid on February 28 to unitholders of record on February 14.</p>
<p>Unitholders of record on February 14 will also be entitled to tax credits under Section 29 of the Internal Revenue Code.</p>
<p>The trust said the distributions decreased this quarter as a result of an increase in expenses related to royalties and taxes.</p>
</text>
